<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->The residents of [kiiro_settlement_label] will be holding a sky lantern festival in the nearby wilderness soon, and they hope you can attend.\n\nThe sky lantern festival was originally a festival held by kiiros every year during aprimay. On the night of the festival, kiiros release paper lanterns into the sky to pray for a safe year ahead.\n\nHowever, with frequent conflicts and displacement due to war, many kiiros lost their homes and were forced into wandering. One day, a surviving kiiro village started using the method of releasing sky lanterns at night, hoping that their wandering companions nearby could follow the lanterns' guidance to find their way back home. This method proved effective, and gradually, this "signal" spread within kiiros.\n\nToday, the sky lanternfestival of kiiros has lost its original meaning, but it has brought peace to the kiiro who found a home in this way.</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_OpportunitySite_SkyLanternFestival.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription->[kiiro_settlement_label]的居民将于近期在附近的野外举办天灯节，她们希望你也能够参加。\n\n天灯节原是绮罗族在每年翠象才会举办的节日，在节日当天的夜里绮罗们会将纸灯放飞到天空，以祈求这一年的平安。\n\n但是随着战乱的频发，不少绮罗失去家乡被迫流浪，于是在某一天，一处幸存的绮罗村落开始使用在夜里放飞天灯的方法，希望还在附近流落的伙伴们能够顺着天灯的指引找到回家的路。这个方法颇为奏效，于是渐渐地这个“暗号”就在绮罗族内传开了。\n\n如今天灯节已经失去了它本来的意义，但它从此也为那些因此而找到归宿的绮罗们带来了平安。</li>
  </Kiiro_OpportunitySite_SkyLanternFestival.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questName->kiiro sky lantern festival</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_OpportunitySite_SkyLanternFestival.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName->绮罗天灯节</li>
  </Kiiro_OpportunitySite_SkyLanternFestival.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <Kiiro_OpportunitySite_SkyLanternFestival.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>任务过期：[resolvedQuestName]</Kiiro_OpportunitySite_SkyLanternFestival.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The kiiro's sky lantern festival has concluded. The residents of [kiiro_settlement_label] are somewhat disappointed that you did not attend. -->
  <Kiiro_OpportunitySite_SkyLanternFestival.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>绮罗族的天灯节已经结束了。[kiiro_settlement_label]的居民们对你没有参加感到有些遗憾。</Kiiro_OpportunitySite_SkyLanternFestival.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [resolvedQuestName] failed -->
  <Kiiro_OpportunitySite_SkyLanternFestival.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>[resolvedQuestName]失效</Kiiro_OpportunitySite_SkyLanternFestival.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Due to the hostile relationship with the kiiros, [resolvedQuestName] cannot be completed further. -->
  <Kiiro_OpportunitySite_SkyLanternFestival.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>由于与绮罗族处于敌对关系，[resolvedQuestName]无法继续完成。</Kiiro_OpportunitySite_SkyLanternFestival.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  
</LanguageData>